\pard\widctlpar\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b 3. Neural Networks\par
\b0 GenAI uses artificial neural networks inspired by the human brain.\par
Components:\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Input Layer\par
