{\listtext\f0 1\tab}Many enterprise image generators \par

\pard 
{\listtext\f0\u10625?\tab}\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b USE CASE FOR EACH SCENERIOS:\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f4\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sb100\sa100\sl300\slmult0\kerning0\f4\fs27 Text Generation\par

\pard\widctlpar\li720\sb100\sa100\sl300\slmult0\b0\fs21 Generative AI can create human-like text such as emails, reports, meeting summaries, blogs, and chatbot responses. It helps users save time by automatically generating clear and relevant content based on a prompt.\par

\pard\widctlpar\li720\sb100\sa100\sl276\slmult1 Eg. Create a marketing campaign description.\par
\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sb100\sa100\sl276\slmult1\b\fs27 Image Generation\b0\fs21\par

\pard\widctlpar\li720\sb100\sa100\sl300\slmult0 Generative AI can create new images from text descriptions. It is widely used for marketing creatives, product designs, social media posts, artwork, architectural visualizations, and concept designs, reducing the need for manual design effort.\par

\pard\widctlpar\li720\sb100\sa100\sl276\slmult1 Eg. Generate campaign banners and product visuals.\par
\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sb100\sa100\sl276\slmult1\b\fs27 Code Generation\b0\fs21\par

\pard\widctlpar\li720\sb100\sa100\sl300\slmult0 Generative AI can generate, debug, and optimize code in programming languages like Python, Java, and C#. It helps developers write functions, create applications, generate test cases, and automate repetitive coding tasks, thereby increasing development speed and productivity.\par

\pard\widctlpar\li720\sb100\sa100\sl276\slmult1 Eg. Build the campaign landing page and automate deployment.\par
\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b Advantages of AI\par

\pard\widctlpar\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 AI improves productivity by automating repetitive tasks, analysing large amounts of data quickly, and helping users make faster decisions. It also enhances creativity, enables personalized experiences, and supports 24/7 customer service.\par
\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b Disadvantages of AI\par

\pard\widctlpar\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 AI can sometimes generate incorrect or biased outputs, known as hallucinations. It may also raise concerns about job displacement, data privacy, security risks, and overdependence on technology. Additionally, AI systems often require significant computing resources and high-quality data.\par
\par

\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b Future of AI\par

\pard\widctlpar\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 The future of AI is expected to focus on more intelligent, multimodal systems that can understand and generate text, images, audio, and video together. AI will play a major role in healthcare, education, finance, manufacturing, and scientific research, helping people work more efficiently while augmenting human capabilities rather than replacing them.\par

